	<key>readme</key>
	<string>Alfred front-end for the pjws project workspace orchestrator.

Keyword: pj

Return     → pjws switch &lt;name&gt;  (falls back to load if not loaded)
Cmd+Enter  → pjws unload &lt;name&gt;  (only valid for loaded projects)

Loaded projects float to the top of the list with their slot and
per-adapter state. The Obsidian singleton is flagged with an
`obsidian` badge on the currently-bound project.

Requires pjws installed at ~/.config/pjws/bin/pjws (chezmoi-managed).</string>
